<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In life and in death, in love mutually</l><l>Standing in one spirit, co-laboring,</l><l>Only for the Body of Christ, and not for self,</l><l>Forming His victorious Bride, age turning.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
